        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-time-p07-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "即将 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "即将 announces an event expected in the near future, especially in formal language. It does not claim completion.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "会议即将开始。",
                "pinyin": "huìyì jíjiāng kāishǐ 。",
                "meaning": "The meeting is about to begin.",
                "audio": "848b55beb7f6deadab18d8a86ce3df43a61754a3e6cab4591d901a4631ef9740"
              },
              {
                "text": "他即将来北京。",
                "pinyin": "tā jíjiāng lái Běijīng 。",
                "meaning": "He will come to Beijing shortly.",
                "audio": "3b66b287a25a9cc6b9a1aaf546854cca6c4c54292546e347db2a26c070af1a98"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
